# Agent skills (repository root)

This monorepo’s git root is the parent of `app/`, `backend/`, `support/`, and `openspec/`. Run `git` and `gh` from that root.

## Git workflow skills

| Skill | Path | When |
| ----- | ---- | ---- |
| Commit changes | `.cursor/skills/commit-changes` | User asks to commit, `/opsx-commit`, or PR auto-commit |
| Create PR | `.cursor/skills/create-pull-request` | User asks to open/create a PR |
| OpenSpec commit | `.cursor/skills/openspec-commit` | `/opsx-commit` after OpenSpec work |
| OpenSpec PR | `.cursor/skills/openspec-pr` | `/opsx-pr` or apply post-ship |

Package-level `commit-changes` / `create-pull-request` skills were removed — use the root skills above.

## Package skills

Read `app/.cursor/skills/SKILL.md`, `backend/.cursor/skills/SKILL.md`, and `support/.cursor/skills/SKILL.md` for package-specific verify, merge readiness, and UI/backend conventions.

